start_welcome.en:
"Ekaabo!" (Welcome!) to the "{course_title}" course, designed just for young Nigerian men like you.

{course_description}

Type /next to begin your first lesson or /help for a list of commands.

start_welcome.ha:
"Sannu!" (Maraba!) ga jerin aiki "{course_title}", wanda aka tsara ga samari Nijeriya kamar ku.

{course_description}

Kunna /next don fara jerin ko /help don jerin umarnin.

start_welcome.yo:
"O ku abo!" (Kaabo!) si eko "{course_title}", ti a dida fun awọn ọkunrin araba ti Naijiria gẹgẹ bi yin.

{course_description}

Kunna /next lati bẹrẹ eko akọkọ rẹ tabi /help fun akojọ awọn aṣayan.

start_welcome.ig:
"Kedu!" (Ndewo!) na echiche "{course_title}", emebere maka ụmụ nwoke Nigeria dika unu.

{course_description}

Biko kunna /next iji malite akwukwo mbụ gị ma /help maka onyonyo.

